== Trivia ==
* This trinket is a reference to [[ouroboros:|Øuroboros]], which was a prototype of the game "The End is Nigh" by Edmund McMillen and Tyler Glaiel.
* The Ouroboros is an ancient symbol, showing a serpent or dragon eating its tail.

